+// TestGitIndexMultiBranchSamePathWithinOneRepoNotRejected guards against a
+// regression the duplicate-path policy could otherwise introduce: a single
+// repository indexing the same relative path with different content on two
+// different branches is normal, existing zoekt behavior, and must not be
+// treated as a cross-input conflict just because that repository always
+// goes through the same group machinery used to merge multiple inputs.
